{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "I Think",
    "steam_appid": 2726980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A programmer was trying to create himself in the electronic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He recreated his diary in 3D space and fed the data to the AI to learn from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI relives his memories and emotions, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but the conclusions the AI draws from his experience do not necessarily match what the programmer had envisioned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will AI evolve and how will programmers perceive it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the world of the programmer's diary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to agree, disagree, or have a different opinion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice will determine the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated play time is 1.5 to 2 hours to reach one ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to play and distribute your own videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization of the distribution is also OK. No prior notice is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Operation Methods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera: Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WSAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Spase</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selection: ZXC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Save</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A programmer was trying to create himself in the electronic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He recreated his diary in 3D space and fed the data to the AI to learn from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI relives his memories and emotions, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but the conclusions the AI draws from his experience do not necessarily match what the programmer had envisioned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will AI evolve and how will programmers perceive it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the world of the programmer's diary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to agree, disagree, or have a different opinion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice will determine the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated play time is 1.5 to 2 hours to reach one ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to play and distribute your own videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization of the distribution is also OK. No prior notice is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Operation Methods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera: Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WSAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Spase</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selection: ZXC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Save</p>",
    "short_description": "One day, a programmer had an idea. If he could make an AI learn his diary and have the same life experiences as himself, he could create himself in the electronic world.",
